<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked ADF fighters have killed dozens of civilians in the Ituri and North Kivu regions, targeting villages such as Cantine and attacking health workers amid the Ebola outbreak. The DR Congo army captured an alleged ADF intelligence officer while the Uganda People’s Defence Force rotated troops to counter the ADF threat. Armed groups remain the main obstacle to controlling Ebola and protecting civilians. The conflict still accounts for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPUlNKa1czLUlvUUJzZkNRNlUwamRMX3FJWGc5X0lSNjQ5Wjl3TjhVNkpaVHYtdy1BdU9EV3F1ajJ4cXg3clVDdzRyTFNVUVhmUTZoNWcxQU5wTUx6UExfcHpyTGFuX1Y3b3Z3WTVNN0w1aDJWMXBDM3kzcmw5a3h5VVh3eDc2RU5sbm1qN1ZIbGdacVNTazVrU0FzWkxpaUw3eXVsZEtQc0ZPcG5EaXRwX2NGSkc0aVN1UndYRHp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBqQ01qb3lwNWhSR0VzZy1pZ2Rxa0VKNllXa0FOaGVJeWg5bnROUm9VaGZhODYwbnQ0Rl9VbXd3THBCMU5LR2tyQkVUWVl1cmFDZV8xckVvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1ZM3Z4SVhSd0VjV3UyQUFtb1V3NUhmVHNJWXo5eEZmLUdjVzQ1SkV6Zkl3SzlhclEtRUJmcEZmVFdJeFNxbXU5YXN2cEpjY1pocnNxLWhvWVkyRnJCdF9ZTXotdHVWS3lXX0lKMWNOME90VjRDSFpmaTNNclc0eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOdzNDQmxiZlVpcTNSOGNDVWQxM2ItZ3dPUU5VWVUzZWp3X2pSUTBDdlNlSGRSNXp5UVVoTkV1RDBMV1RPSGRpeHBZdzkzWTNyaWRrQkloNFlRcEVVRjBCdVJlc2FCZnNWV0VrS0xqenpLdEhmN3RkVU4xWng2c3RwOFNFZmpWeEdfOTVWVUh6NlktdjNUcGp0QlozT3R3aF9jeGVieDF4ZVlfZHBKU0lLa3RR?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news